<IPA_transcription>No transcription given</IPA_transcription>
<gloss>The Afrikaanse Language/ I am a poor farm girl/ not thought much of by many/ however, I am of noble blood/ and of high class/ My father came from Holland/ to sunny Africa/ My mother came from France/ where bunches of grapes grow</gloss>
